        <h2>KYC Verification Update 📋</h2>

        <p>Hello {{name}},</p>

        <p>We're sorry, but your <strong>KYC verification could not be approved</strong> at this time.</p>

        {{#if reason}}
        <div class="info-box">
            <strong>Reason:</strong> {{reason}}
        </div>
        {{/if}}

        {{#if comments}}
        <p><strong>Additional details:</strong> {{comments}}</p>
        {{/if}}

        <p>Here's what you can do:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Double-check the documents you submitted (make sure they are clear and valid)</li>
            <li>Re-submit your KYC documents from your profile page</li>
            <li>Contact support if you believe this is a mistake</li>
        </ul>

        <center>
            <a href="{{kycUrl}}" class="button">Re-submit KYC</a>
        </center>

        <p>We're here to help — feel free to reach out anytime.</p>

        <p>Best Regards,<br>The RentEase Team</p>
